   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-05-31",
   "text": "Federal Gas Tax Suspension and Windfall Profits Tax Act of 2022\n This bill suspends the excise tax on gasoline (other than aviation gasoline) until December 31, 2023. It also imposes a 50% tax on the excess profits of certain large oil companies in the first taxable year after 2021."
  }
